   "install": {
    "title": "Getting started",
    "html": "<p>The easiest way to deploy paperless is <code>docker compose</code>. The files in the <a href=\"https://github.com/paperless-ngx/paperless-ngx/tree/main/docker/compose\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><code>/docker/compose</code> directory</a> are configured to pull the image from the GitHub container registry.</p>\n<p>If you'd like to jump right in, you can configure a <code>docker compose</code> environment with our install script:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">bash -c \"$(curl -L https://raw.githubusercontent.com/paperless-ngx/paperless-ngx/main/install-paperless-ngx.sh)\"\n</code></pre>\n<p>More details and step-by-step guides for alternative installation methods can be found in <a href=\"https://docs.paperless-ngx.com/setup/#installation\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">the documentation</a>.</p>\n<p>Migrating from Paperless-ng is easy, just drop in the new docker image! See the <a href=\"https://docs.paperless-ngx.com/setup/#migrating-to-paperless-ngx\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">documentation on migrating</a> for more details.</p>\n<h5>Documentation</h5>\n<p>The documentation for Paperless-ngx is available at <a href=\"https://docs.paperless-ngx.com/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://docs.paperless-ngx.com</a>.</p>",
    "truncated": false,
    "chars": 981
   },
   "usage": null,
   "features": {
    "title": "Features",
    "html": "<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/paperless-ngx/paperless-ngx/main/docs/assets/screenshots/documents-smallcards.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" />\n<p>A full list of <a href=\"https://docs.paperless-ngx.com/#features\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">features</a> and <a href=\"https://docs.paperless-ngx.com/#screenshots\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">screenshots</a> are available in the <a href=\"https://docs.paperless-ngx.com/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">documentation</a>.</p>",
